md rewrites the three asterisks as three hyphens, so replacing the
paragraph in the middle also edits the break at the bottom.

ReplaceCommand rebuilds the whole document with BlockFormatter, and
BlockFormatter prints every thematic break as ---, because
MarkdownBlock.thematicBreak carries only its position and not the
characters that spelled it. This is the same root cause as
remove-keeps-asterisk-bullets-in-an-untouched-list: a block the user
did not name is re-spelled from a model that never held the
original bytes.
